---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Free Forex Signal Bots | BlueFx Markets" description="Sample forex signal bots for BlueFx Markets, including NAD crosses and synthetics." page="signals">
<main id="content">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Tools / Free Forex Signals Bots</p>
        <h1>Free forex signal bots</h1>
        <p class="lede">Four sample bots for the Namibia desk. Enabling one marks it in this browser. It does not send an order to MT5 and it does not touch a NAD balance.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="bot-grid" id="bot-grid"></div>
        <h2 style="margin:34px 0 8px">Live demo feed</h2>
        <p class="sub">New rows appear on a timer so the feed feels like a desk. Entries, stops and targets are illustrative.</p>
        <div id="signal-feed" style="margin-top:16px"></div>
        <p class="note">Signals can be wrong. A sample hit rate is not a promise. Read the risk disclosure before you treat any row as a trade, and remember the account currency on BlueFx is NAD even when the symbol is quoted in dollars.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
